  "solution_ref": "$f=(x-1)(x-2)(x-k)$, $f'(0)=2k+k+2=-7$ → $k=-3$. $f(3)=12$, 직선 $y=4x$. $B-A=\\int_0^3(-x^3+11x-6)dx=-\\frac{81}4+\\frac{99}2-18=\\frac{45}4$",
